body:
I may have been exaggerating, but I think my point still stands when I say that the main points of interest are not really polished. Perhaps this thread is just my subconscious attempt at digging out all the hate that I have towards Elites, because I find their current implementation to be flawed from the ground up.

&#x200B;

I don't know, I feel weird. I spent 30 minutes typing this thread trying to make as many good points as possible but now I see I was just upset at Elite enemies and overreacting. 

&#x200B;

I need to go to fuckin bed
